 13667	  2751	    36
 13668	  2752	    37	```gherkin
 13669	  2753	    38	Given a hash-bound three-case fixture with four independent search routes per case
 13670	  2754	    39	When the regression suite is deserialized and evaluated
 13671	  2755	    40	Then deterministic full coverage, route increments, leave-one-route-out loss, gaps, and bounded human minutes are returned
 13672	  2756	    41	And the result remains a passive evaluation artifact
 13673	  2757	    42	```
